From c8c3077bb0244c30f0ae4d5b318dfc827d58ecc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Elara <elara@portal.local>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:46:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] brand: subscriptions instead of profiles, portal mode names,
 no direct
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Profiles are subscriptions in the UI now (RU: подписки, EN: subscriptions):
  the list entry, the added/updated tips and the age hint.
- The two modes the user sees are ПРОСТОЙ ПОРТАЛ (global) and СЕТЬ ПОРТАЛОВ (rules);
  the engine keeps its own names, only the labels changed.
- DIRECT is gone from every place a user can reach it: the dashboard mode card,
  the tray menu and the hotkey list. The enum stays so configs that mention it
  still parse; the portal being off is the only untunnelled state we expose.
